# Files kept OUT of the packaged .vsix. Keep: out/ (compiled JS, the entry point), daemon/ (bundled
# analyser), package.json, README.md (the marketplace page), icon.png, LICENSE, and the NOTICE and THIRD-PARTY.txt
# that vscode:package copies in from the repository root. Everything below is dev-only or redundant.
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
src/**
out/test/**
out/uitest/**
uitest-fixture/**
.vscode-test.mjs
out/**/*.map
**/tsconfig.json
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
package-lock.json
*.vsix
DEVELOPING.md
